{"id":60518,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=60518"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:30:52","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:30:52","slug":"pinga-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pinga-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Pinga Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pinga Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pinga Trail 2026<\/strong> (9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Arruda dos Vinhos<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lisboa<\/strong>. Com arranque das provas competitivas marcado para as <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:30<\/strong> (ap\u00f3s o *briefing* t\u00e9cnico das <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">08:50<\/strong>) e da caminhada \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:35<\/strong>, o evento convida-te a explorar os trilhos outonais da regi\u00e3o vinhateira de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Arruda dos Vinhos<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sob o mote *\"De Forte em Forte at\u00e9 ao Vulc\u00e3o\"*, os percursos circulares levam-te a percorrer os hist\u00f3ricos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Fortes e Caminhos Militares das Linhas de Torres<\/strong> e os trilhos t\u00e9cnicos do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vale Encantado<\/strong>. Podes optar pelo exigente <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Longo de 23 km<\/strong>, pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Curto de 16 km<\/strong> ou pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada \u201cCondado Portucalense\u201d de 10 km<\/strong>, aberta tanto a caminhantes como a quem pretenda trotar sem press\u00e3o de cron\u00f3metro.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o K4ninos Runners<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Arruda dos Vinhos<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 limitada a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">500 participantes<\/strong> e inclui pr\u00e9mio de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, pr\u00e9mio *finisher*, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, transporte para a meta em caso de abandono, banhos e trof\u00e9us para a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral, escal\u00f5es (Seniores a M\/F 60) e top 3 de equipas. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Arruda dos Vinhos, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label